    {
      "id": "sec-url-filter",
      "title": "URL filter",
      "group": "security",
      "order": 10,
      "icon": "link-2-off",
      "description": "Block or allow web addresses for LAN clients.",
      "stock": {
        "menu": "ssmURLFilter",
        "page": "sec_url_filter_t.gch",
        "handler": [
          "all_url_gch.gch",
          "fw_url_gch.gch",
          "fw_base_gch.gch",
          "sec_url_filter_conf_js.gch"
        ]
      },
      "applicable": true,
      "apply": "unknown",
      "danger": "confirm",
      "sections": [
        {
          "id": "global",
          "title": "Filter",
          "table": "FWBase",
          "mode": "single",
          "row": 0,
          "fields": [
            {
              "dm": "UrlFilterEnable",
              "label": "Enable URL filter",
              "type": "bool"
            },
            {
              "dm": "UrlFilterTarget",
              "label": "Mode",
              "type": "enum",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "0",
                  "label": "Block listed (blacklist)"
                },
                {
                  "value": "1",
                  "label": "Allow only listed (whitelist)"
                }
              ],
              "help": "Allow-only blocks every site that is not listed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rules",
          "title": "URL list",
          "table": "FWURL",
          "mode": "list",
          "addable": true,
          "deletable": true,
          "rowLabel": "{Url}",
          "fields": [
            {
              "dm": "Url",
              "label": "URL",
              "type": "string",
              "min": 1,
              "max": 256,
              "required": true,
              "column": true,
              "pattern": "^[0-9A-Za-z.:;,!@%#?_/&=+*'$()\\[\\]-]{1,256}$",
              "help": "Host name or URL, 1-256 characters."
            },
            {
              "dm": "Enable",
              "label": "Enabled",
              "type": "bool",
              "default": "0",
              "advanced": true,
              "help": "The global switch above turns filtering on or off."
            },
            {
              "dm": "FilterTarget",
              "label": "Rule target",
              "type": "enum",
              "default": "0",
              "advanced": true,
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "0",
                  "label": "Discard"
                },
                {
                  "value": "1",
                  "label": "Permit"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": "OBJ_FWBASE_ID -> FWBase (row 0) for the switch and mode; OBJ_FWURL_ID -> FWURL rows (ViewName, Enable, Url, FilterTarget). FWURL is empty on this device, so its DM names are taken from the OBJ parameter list (stock param names == DM names elsewhere) and are unverified. UrlFilterTarget 0/1 = Discard/Permit (stock option values). Stock 'enable' and 'mode' changes submit immediately (basic_apply). No row limit in the stock JS (pv Max 1024). Stock applies through OBJ_* set_inst, which notifies the firewall module at once. A raw `sidbg DB set` + save is expected to need a reboot (or a firewall reload) to take effect; unverified. UI-text notes moved here: [Enable]: Stock always writes 0; the global switch above governs filtering. | [FilterTarget]: Stock always writes 0."
    },
